        "| Name  | Time        | Location & Zoom |\n",
        "|-------|-------------|-----------------|\n",
        "| Cinda | Mon 2–4pm   | 🏢 ICCS 233 · <a href=\"https://ubc.zoom.us/j/5393867685?pwd=N01ZS2dLbVorQkRzcDRuNTdwQmRYUT09\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/Zoom_Communications_Logo.svg\" alt=\"Zoom\" style=\"height:16px; vertical-align:middle;\"></a> |\n",
        "| Joe   | Fri 11-12a | 🏢 FORW 317 |\n",
